<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">How Expert Education transformed international payments</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Expert Education,</strong> a top agent assisting over 5,000 students annually, transformed their international payment processes by adopting <strong><span style="color: #48b985;">Flywire's StudyLink Accept &amp; Pay.</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />The results were immediate and powerful:</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: none;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>Significant Time Savings:</strong></span> Saving counselors 3–5 minutes per application.</li> 
<li><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>Increased Efficiency:</strong> </span>Payments became faster and fully integrated.</li> 
<li><strong><span style="color: #147bd1;">Enhanced Security:</span> </strong>Fraud concerns for students were eliminated.</li> 
</ul> </li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Read this case study and discover how Flywire's solutions can streamline the student journey, boost efficiency, and build critical trust.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
