<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">Unlock insights on Brazil's booming international student market </span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Brazil's international student market is expanding rapidly, with a 50% increase in students studying abroad since 2017. Are you ready to engage with this dynamic and growing market?</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Our latest blog post, "<span style="color: #48b985;"><strong>Essential International Education Insights for Brazilian Education Agents and Global Institutions</strong></span>," provides a deep dive into:</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: none;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>The top destination countries and the rise of new student hotspots.<br />Shifting preferences from language courses to higher education.</li> 
<li>The role of social media in student decision-making.</li> 
<li>Key strategies to address the primary financial hurdles for Brazilian students.</li> 
</ul> </li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Don't miss out on these crucial insights.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
