<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">Flywire Agent Platform Update: </span></p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Add an extra</p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">layer of security with 2FA</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Your Flywire account is now safer than ever. Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) is available to all users — and it only takes a minute to set up.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><strong>Why turn it on?</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: none;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Block unauthorized access</li> 
<li>Protect sensitive student &amp; payment data</li> 
<li>Gain peace of mind with one simple step</li> 
</ul> </li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Enable 2FA today in the Flywire Agent Platform under <strong>“My Account.”</strong> It’s quick to set up and gives you lasting protection.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
