</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Partner with an innovative and inclusive French business school that fosters its students’ passion and sees in each of them tomorrow’s leaders in transforming business and society.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">As a pillar of higher education, we believe one thing above all: education should open new paths to help build the future—your students’ future. With a vibrant, intercultural community of students, 210 faculty-researchers from around the globe, and more than 400 prestigious academic partners, NEOMA offers an environment of academic excellence that prepares students to thrive in a changing world.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">The School offers a wide choice of programs, from Bachelor-level to a Master in Management and Masters of Science in diverse areas of expertise (AI, sustainability, finance, etc.).</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Introduce your students to the choice of excellence—partner with <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://neoma-bs.com/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=on-the-fly-q3-2025"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>NEOMA</u></strong></span></a><span style="background-color: transparent;">.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
