<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Flywire shines</p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">at the AA Education agent retreat</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">We were excited to mark a significant milestone by partnering with A&amp;A Education for their first collaborative agent retreat outside the Jiangzhehu region, held in Qingdao.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">The event engaged 80 high-value agents, most of whom are current Flywire partners. Through structured speed-networking and group sessions, we deepened relationships, addressed partner needs, and reinforced the core advantages of our platform.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">This initiative successfully expanded our regional influence and significantly strengthened loyalty and engagement within our existing partner network.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
