<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Building connections: Flywire at IDP events across India</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Over the course of two weeks, from August 21 to September 2, Flywire's team in India had an exceptional presence at a series of IDP-sponsored events. The team connected with thousands of students, parents, and over 30 global universities across eight major cities. Our engagement was a significant success, creating new opportunities to support education agents like you.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Key highlights that directly benefit our agent partners include:</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: none;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><strong>Positive Student Engagement:</strong> Our team conducted live demonstrations of Flywire's payment platform, which generated significant excitement among students. They saw firsthand how simple and secure it is to pay for their international education, which means less time and effort for you spent on payment-related inquiries.</li> 
<li><strong>Enhanced Visibility:</strong> The strong interest and high turnout—including over 900 registrations in Mumbai—have raised Flywire’s profile. This increased visibility helps us build deeper relationships with universities, ultimately leading to a more seamless and reliable payment process for your students.</li> 
</ul> </li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Partnership is at the heart of everything we do. Hear directly from IDP about why they continue to trust Flywire and how together we’re supporting students and institutions around the world. Learn more <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/video-testimonial-idp?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=on-the-fly-q3-2025"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>here</u></strong></span></a>.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
